OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor paid #19k despite
OL,4,Asix-month no-show
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former councillor who lost his seat
OL,7,Fafter failing to turn up to a single
OL,8,Fcouncil meeting for six months was paid
OL,9,F#18,888 and may be able to earn the
OL,10,Fsame amount again after putting himself
OL,11,Fforward to stand in the by-election he
OL,12,Ftriggered.
OL,14,FJohn Allen was elected to represent
OL,15,FAshington's Hirst ward on
OL,16,FNorthumberland County Council in May
OL,17,F2025.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
