OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor paid #19k despite
OL,4,Asix-month no-show
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authority said Allen, alongside
OL,7,Fevery one of its elected councillors
OL,8,Fthat year, had been paid the sum to
OL,9,Fcover duties, constituency work,
OL,10,Fpostage and stationery.
OL,12,FIt said it had no powers to reclaim the
OL,13,Fmoney and the by-election's successful
OL,14,Fcandidate, even if it was Allen again,
OL,15,Fwould also be paid #18,888. Allen has
OL,16,Fbeen approached for comment.
